{"id":727,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Incineroar’s rough and aggressive behavior is its most notable trait, but the way it helps out small Pokémon shows that it has a kind side as well."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It excels at violent, no-holds-barred battles. The temperature of the flames that issue from its navel exceeds 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"When its fighting spirit is set alight, the flames around its waist become especially intense."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Although it’s rough mannered and egotistical, it finds beating down unworthy opponents boring. It gets motivated for stronger opponents."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"After hurling ferocious punches and flinging furious kicks, it finishes opponents off by spewing fire from around its navel."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"This Pokémon has a violent, selfish disposition. If it’s not in the mood to listen, it will ignore its Trainer’s orders with complete nonchalance."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Blaze","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Fire-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":true,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Red","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":725,"name":"Litten","condition":null,"children":[{"id":726,"name":"Torracat","condition":"Lv. 17","children":[{"id":727,"name":"Incineroar","condition":"Lv. 34","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,663],[1,52],[1,122],[1,238],[1,339],[9,46],[12,154],[15,44],[20,24],[25,424],[30,184],[32,207],[44,53],[51,37],[58,394]],"machine":[512,332,226,307,34,280,339,523,807,370,242,399,38,409,89,283,203,263,126,424,519,7,83,488,53,394,374,411,264,416,535,257,270,63,442,282,808,141,67,490,417,200,315,182,156,179,46,184,815,421,214,555